Subject: [PATCH 02/13] feat(selection): frame-evidence gameplay moment
 detection

Fuses seven per-second visual signals (agreement required) with audio as
support only; episodes get lead-in and payoff-aware windows and a reason.
Opt-out via FRAME_EVIDENCE_SELECTION=0. Stand-in fixture: recall 1.0,
precision 1.0, decoy not selected (baseline: recall 0.5, decoy top-ranked).
